{"c":[{"id":"3d8e48dcd08287d182bc685bd04825c71616f10666d7705b2ae2b5c62a444c93","sum":"AGENT_BIN vs CLI_NAME; VISION/ROADMAP retired (README+atlas+notes+MB). tox py311-py314; nested recall; skipped-a-pack. Script is the only writer (files are the work). Note membership is clone-portability; no OptMem in the prompt. Onboarding: docs/agents-prompt.md lockstep.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"4078d7c411ce74e328e7d384205a21789896da17eaa37545962f39ad53aba872","sum":"AGENT_BIN vs CLI_NAME; VISION/ROADMAP retired for README+atlas+notes+memory-bank. tox py311-py314 no result cache; nested recall; skipped-a-pack on bad sibling; script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5e4f97413b312154574a52b782dc0223d281329c033146c1f7175c8dbb73e1a5","sum":"Run: uses AGENT_BIN; help catalog uses CLI_NAME. VISION/ROADMAP retired; living docs are README, docs/architecture/ (atlas), docs/notes.md leftovers, and the memory-bank.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"667b5bd40e9be23ddeec380c5631a3fc8f731cf58d56db154c12dedfa451142e","sum":"Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem); help catalog uses CLI_NAME. VISION/ROADMAP sunset; living docs are README, docs/, and the memory-bank.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T023238Z-bbf825b6f524dcb6","text":"Nap Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem), same as the baked prompt; usage_text keeps CLI_NAME (summem).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T025054Z-8222dbc737ce85a4","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are being sunset: leftovers go under docs/; README and memory-bank become the living docs; VISION is no longer the design contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"5e022ef533bec84293259aa4a3c815b8633f4e3e47847b355f86fca71dea8117","sum":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md retired. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/ (the atlas), docs/notes.md leftovers, and the memory-bank. VISION is not the contract.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T025220Z-1a52749b783612ee","text":"docs-sunset plan: VISION/ROADMAP retire; architecture lives at docs/architecture/; leftovers (sqlite, hooks, cover(T), pack-size, hot margin) at docs/notes.md; README is the public face.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T030457Z-f1b0d73acb7f8b59","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are gone. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/, docs/notes.md, and the memory-bank. The architecture page is the atlas; VISION is not the contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"746cce2a386de2cd57d2f77ca19b292c0189cb60363f6c86944d9fead44d9a99","sum":"tox is py311-py314 pytest, no result cache unless proven on this suite; recall matches nested nap captions; zoom/recall warn 'skipped a pack' on an unreadable sibling children file (wake silent). Script-written files are part of the work; the script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"29530a97880a269e660dbdfe6943053f229dc80d93cafa9e9c7e269e0e3077e7","sum":"tox is the pytest suite on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10; no test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite); recall matches nested nap captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr for an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T034719Z-9ead1d6adb1f23f2","text":"Niko L2 tox-pytest-runner: one tox command for pytest on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10); skip test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T035449Z-38690d9f52484de6","text":"recall matches nested NapChild.sum captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr when they skip an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1cd145ba45ef49e6f3e7ca4db21d5e5f372f7e8b3109cdcf8637f9501cb76952","sum":"tox is the suite (py311-py314, no result cache). Files the script writes are part of the work: git-add them; the script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T040400Z-6f72c4e24f7307a3","text":"tox is the suite command: tox.ini package=skip, py311-py314, no test-result cache; 211 pytest. This uv only had 3.14.0rc3.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T044725Z-82b67eae5e042401","text":"After note or nap, git add the files the script wrote and commit them; the script stays the only writer.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"97fbdbf480d21d0c8108533b22cd6c3d96c8563889ceb0cfb6dd24d4250c8f17","sum":"Script-written files are part of the work (not untracked). Note membership is clone-portability; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Too long: N/limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake. Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md lockstep; TDD skips consumer Actions YAML.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"0b347fe3d88d59693652675b59b880685fde23691a41f3118fda96c9747b7d7b","sum":"Files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. Note membership is clone-portability on its own sentence; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Over-long note/nap prints Too long: N bytes, limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"4826b3cd066a8db2620210390a81c866632063b629b0c6d392ee396a30ce7a9a","sum":"Files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. prompt-commit-notes archived (PR #15).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T143121Z-499b95db35c236dc","text":"Prompt: files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. Not a separate git add procedure.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T143747Z-07042dccd58a8627","text":"prompt-commit-notes archived: files the script writes are part of your work; do not leave them untracked. Draft PR #15.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0e2730939d36cf17a89286ebd9a998c74e328ccd4fe5e8f6b4894759e1fd26cb","sum":"Note membership is clone-portability on its own sentence; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Over-long note/nap prints Too long: N bytes, limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T144333Z-54317d52fae15bc6","text":"Note membership: session spawn 'document this machine gap' beat the baked filter because it is a trailing clause in the mandatory-note paragraph. Store/CLI stay; split the test onto its own clone-portability sentence. Do not name OptMem in the prompt.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T150951Z-48c09749f6b4d942","text":"Over-long note and nap captions print Too long: N bytes, limit L. Accented characters cost 2 bytes. Compress it further. Identity-miss unknown id says copy from wake; a missing children file does not.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"528f08ae8bb4cf55e61ee2cb2820b7ea4e7359fe50f27467eb457914754ecf88","sum":"Register Memories notes clone-portable facts (dump vs membership split); dump line does not say git forever. Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md lockstep with prompt_text(); TDD does not govern consumer Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"e2a8c1aafb975d1255be62cc74c014574166bc1501da4f799d2041e25d93f0b9","sum":"Baked Register Memories: note a fact another contributor would still need; membership is clone-portability on its own sentence (dump vs membership split). Dump line no longer says git forever.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T152829Z-ff3349020923cee6","text":"Baked Register Memories: note when another contributor would still need the fact; membership is clone-portability on its own sentence. Dump line no longer says git forever.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T165146Z-3869ac160fa1eda4","text":"Draft PR #18: baked Register Memories splits dump from clone-portability membership; no store/CLI change.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"89acc35894e248e23a8823606c8ba122a3a1931afff4346b729ba66d0334114f","sum":"Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md, lockstep with prompt_text(); do not select wrapping init output. TDD does not govern consumer Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action; it would if SumMem were an Action.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T184134Z-2efc5cdcb2d8b149","text":"Onboarding prompt is docs/agents-prompt.md, lockstep with prompt_text(); do not select wrapping init output.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T193911Z-1a2508c0f3d6386f","text":"TDD does not govern GitHub Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action; it would if SumMem were an Action.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7adc29ef51880740f1f6163c28500f7b06b5b90fd531763e85db8f29b1a710c7","sum":"Onboarding is init; version/Release Please/coverage are product; note prints Saved.; surgery.py emergency delete; AGPL plus 0BSD+§7 in the summem header only.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"460feb3ed8c0607d1056cb57f61ce295380371b4de3ec510e9fbfb5a32b540b3","sum":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text); version prints __version__, Release Please tracks extra-files, consumer Actions YAML is not product TDD. Coverage: pytest-cov measures the no-suffix driver; tox -e coverage uploads lcov.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"1b57bafcd1f51c0854547c5c392af690292a130b6f63f1132a03dcdfa190d8ca","sum":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text()); version-tracking archived (PR #22): version prints __version__, Release Please extra-files; consumer Actions YAML is not product TDD.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"9280565a8f63c4956ac8d3f5446630be6b3c85a440463d011060867023721db9","sum":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text()), not a docs/agents-prompt.md copy. summem version prints __version__; Release Please extra-files bump repo-root summem.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T194852Z-ea2b60e530376ca4","text":"ship-prompt-file archived; onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md; draft PR #21.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T195810Z-0def08186d21b807","text":"summem version prints __version__; Release Please simple extra-files bump repo-root summem via x-release-please-version.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"eacada5aac0af2308d844dbea814a4a3047786b1b599cd8a02ba9d20622eec05","sum":"version-tracking archived (PR #22): summem version prints __version__; Release Please extra-files; consumer Actions YAML is not product TDD (same class as .cursor-rules#116).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T195859Z-a205a695beb1a648","text":"Preflight FAIL on consumer release-please.yaml was the same class as Texarkanine/.cursor-rules#116 (TDD encoding of tooling as product).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T203536Z-5ee598da385c9137","text":"version-tracking archived: summem version prints __version__; Release Please simple extra-files on repo-root summem; PR #22.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"94271e53e4e390e8130bd1709e53eac96b5d1cbed1034657ed494aa690aaa715","sum":"Coverage: pytest-cov measures the no-suffix driver; tox -e coverage uploads lcov (PR #23).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"9c098318cdba7a6c04832c0396abf56641778da7500b6cd3e6e9b6cfe7684dba","sum":"pytest-cov --cov=summem measures the no-suffix driver; tox -e coverage writes coverage/lcov.info (lcov SF path summem), while default tox stays coverage-free.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T204638Z-78eb1773319c702b","text":"pytest-cov --cov=summem measures the no-suffix shebang; lcov SF path is summem.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T205716Z-2ff58bd8d1240b01","text":"tox -e coverage writes coverage/lcov.info via pytest-cov --cov=summem; default tox stays coverage-free.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e4a889eeb8ef62b88773baa366c199c12511bb1cf2605c973ee38a71666b63c7","sum":"Draft PR #23 archived: tox -e coverage uploads lcov to Codecov; README badge.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T210212Z-1d110b7fc5fdd2af","text":"Draft PR #23: tox -e coverage uploads lcov to Codecov; README badge.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T213032Z-d2f8289f08d361a6","text":"codecov-upload archived: tox -e coverage uploads lcov; README badge; draft PR #23.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"687bf44f7f1d1ca981e6a6303072f0429ab71203b8ec1e50f6381646ddd07eab","sum":"Root wake labels a non-empty git-root document; note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request; emergency delete is surgery.py; note-ack-surgery L4 capped; AGPL program, 0BSD+§7 in the summem header only (PR #32)","tree":{"c":[{"id":"75ea440c81cc93d73967ebb5c779efa82c4a660c10323b2e3db6c81d640d4d49","sum":"Root wake labels a non-empty git-root document; note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request (do not retry); emergency delete is surgery.py, not a subcommand","tree":{"c":[{"id":"08c734f3ed243af8d0a8ebaf38bcb113eaee72ffd2f3eaa7afd7b27a88c47b47","sum":"Root wake labels a non-empty git-root document; emergency delete is surgery.py (zipper out, unlink one note, heal_view), not a subcommand","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T233118Z-a3b7a5135628a4f0","text":"Root wake prints == Project-root Memories == when the git-root document is non-empty, catalog or not. Pull wakes stay unlabeled.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260821T155541Z-842d10e98fbc74de","text":"Emergency delete is repo-root surgery.py, not a summem subcommand: zipper break-out of containing naps, unlink that one note, heal_view; it does not rewrite git history or write nap captions.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8c9885aa12cc2275c410460b0a6571edd29d32f283668f4411bf3511de6e5067","sum":"Successful note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request; the nap is extra work on already-stored memory - do not retry the same note (PR #29 closed #27)","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260821T160046Z-f394b9340bcc2577","text":"Successful summem note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request. A nap after note is extra work on already-stored memory; do not retry the same note.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260821T160735Z-ea1c2c79f1a46533","text":"Draft PR #29 feat/note-ack closes #27: successful note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request; do not retry the same note.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4d2319ab67d787e7960b565eeb139251072a7ae48f1b78fb5880dd1721ae00e1","sum":"note-ack-surgery L4 capped (#29+#30); program is AGPL, 0BSD prompt and §7 invocation live only in the summem header; LICENSE verbatim; surgery.py stock AGPL (PR #32)","tree":{"c":[{"id":"98bd8ec9648a6a8bbe5f66081dd5996ac1f292d8561ab2a8746452a425f68abb","sum":"note-ack-surgery L4 capped (#29+#30 merged, archive on main). Program is AGPL; 0BSD prompt and §7 invocation permission live in the summem header (authoritative); LICENSE stays verbatim AGPL; surgery.py echoes invocation only.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260821T172411Z-b5e0645705ca3183","text":"L4 note-ack-surgery capped: #29 and #30 merged; capstone archive memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260821-note-ack-surgery.md on main.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260823T191515Z-afdba13a71a9e2b8","text":"Program is AGPL; prompt template is 0BSD and invocation is a section 7 additional permission, both in the summem header (authoritative). LICENSE stays verbatim AGPL; surgery.py echoes invocation only.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"55a93401f0823aa511816d387141a4a761b64ffc0a62e58b800626198c0fc4ac","sum":"surgery.py stays stock AGPL; §7 invocation + 0BSD prompt live only in the summem header; agpl-carve-outs archived as PR #32","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260823T191944Z-6b284f7ab99096b8","text":"surgery.py stays stock AGPL. The section 7 invocation permission and 0BSD prompt terms live only in the summem header.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260823T193232Z-015b467b7a2c8879","text":"agpl-carve-outs archived to memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260823-agpl-carve-outs.md; draft PR #32.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
